{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：S05仅停留18秒，却连续安排多组未标注时出现的感受词，扫读压力明显高于X。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的【】强调让观众即使没有时间读完句子，也能迅速抓住人物每一阶段的心理变化；话与感受交替出现，又有音乐节点上的精准提示，使感受不只是堆砌形容词，而能对应具体的旋律、声部、呼吸和情绪转折。更重要的是，Y把从害怕暴露需要、确认亲近、渴望互相依靠，到害怕失去、最终不再隐藏喜欢的过程串得更细，人物为什么这样想、为什么下一刻又改变，都更容易理解。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "7719bf15-07fc-4372-8dd3-07c755564fd6", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T012051813804Z", "elapsed_seconds": 78.125, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T01:22:09.951578+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "92125a736f448a34482b4c65ad33f19d13d894ba41b4977b1fa5763a604a143a", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedf